     </article>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <article>\n              <h3>Graph Embedding Techniques Reveal Synaptic Motifs in EM Datasets</h3>\n              <p class="meta">Moreno, L., Zhang, W., &amp; Singh, R. (2023). <em>Neuroinformatics</em>, 21(4), 299–312.</p>\n              <p>Demonstrates graph embeddings for classifying synapse types and discovering connectivity motifs in reconstructed neural circuits.</p>\n            </article>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <article>\n              <h3>Integrative Single-Cell Atlas of Human Cerebral Organoids</h3>\n              <p class="meta">Moreno, L. et al. (2022). <em>Cell Systems</em>, 9(1), 67–82.</p>\n              <p>Presents an integrated atlas combining single-cell RNA-seq, ATAC-seq, and spatial measurements for human cortical organoids.</p>\n            </article>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <article>\n              <h3>Explainable AI Techniques in Neural Decoding</h3>\n              <p class="meta">Chen, J., Moreno, L., &amp; Russo, M. (2021). <em>Frontiers in Neuroscience</em>, 15, 756843.</p>\n              <p>Reviews attribution and decision-boundary methods for improving trust in neural decoding models.</p>\n            </article>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class="section muted" aria-labelledby="project-publications">\n        <div class="container card-grid">\n          <article class="card">\n            <p class="eyebrow">DeepVision</p>\n            <h2 id="project-publications">High-resolution neural activity mapping</h2>\n            <p>Methods emerging from the DeepVision project support real-time processing of two-photon recordings and interpretable decoding of sensory representations.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class="card">\n            <p class="eyebrow">NeuroGraph</p>\n            <h2>Connectomics and graph learning</h2>\n            <p>The NeuroGraph toolkit has been adopted by 12 labs worldwide for graph-based analysis of electron-microscopy reconstructions.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class="card">\n            <p class="eyebrow">CellMap</p>\n            <h2>Multi-modal single-cell atlas</h2>\n            <p>CellMap integrates scRNA-seq, ATAC-seq, and spatial FISH data to resolve cell-type hierarchies in human cortical organoids.</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class="site-footer">\n      <div class="container footer-grid">\n        <p>&copy; 2025 Dr. Lydia Moreno.</p>\n        <p><a href="index.html">About</a> · <a href="publications.html">Publications</a> · <a href="blog.html">Blog</a></p>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </body>\n</html>\n'
