            <h3><a href="#interpretable-deep-learning">Building Interpretable Deep Learning Models for Neuroscience</a></h3>
            <p>How my group combines temporal convolutional networks, attribution checks, and experimental validation to make neural decoders more transparent.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="post-card">
            <p class="meta">January 2025 · Data integration</p>
            <h3><a href="#single-cell-genomics">Bridging Machine Learning and Single-Cell Genomics</a></h3>
